{
  "id": "06161_torihazusu",
  "headword": "{取|と}り{外|はず}す",
  "reading": "とりはずす",
  "part_of_speech": "verb (godan)",
  "gloss": "to remove, to detach",
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "to remove, to take off, to detach",
      "explanation": "To physically remove or separate something that was attached or installed."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "06161_torihazusu_ex1",
      "japanese": "ドアのネジを{取|と}り{外|はず}してください。",
      "english": "Please remove the screws from the door.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "06161_torihazusu_ex2",
      "japanese": "カバーを{取|と}り{外|はず}せば、{中|なか}が{見|み}える。",
      "english": "If you remove the cover, you can see inside.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "06161_torihazusu_ex3",
      "japanese": "エアコンを{取|と}り{外|はず}すには{専門業者|せんもんぎょうしゃ}に{頼|たの}んだほうがいい。",
      "english": "You should hire a professional to remove the air conditioner.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    }
  ],
  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY: {他動詞|たどうし} (transitive). Intransitive pair: {取|と}り{外|はず}れる. Compound verb: {取|と}る + {外|はず}す. Pattern: Xを{取|と}り{外|はず}す (remove X).\n\nASPECT: ている indicates resulting state. {取|と}り{外|はず}してある = 'has been removed' (is in a removed state).\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n・ネジを{取|と}り{外|はず}す (remove screws)\n・カバーを{取|と}り{外|はず}す (remove a cover)\n・{部品|ぶひん}を{取|と}り{外|はず}す (remove parts)\n・{簡単|かんたん}に{取|と}り{外|はず}せる (can be easily removed)\n\nOPPOSITE: {取|と}り{付|つ}ける (to attach, to install).",
